<p>Alright. Its review time. Overall I liked it. It uses the owl's predatory abilities and ability to rotate its head to creepy effects, and I enjoy the simplicity of the article.</p>
<p>Some minor nitpicks:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-2862 is contained in an empty and featureless 15 sq m room.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I wonder if this would be better expressed as 15&#160;m<sup>2</sup>.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>In the case of containment breach</p>
