<p>Maybe try &quot;In the event of a containment breach.</p>
<p>Also, I have to wonder what is preventing scaled down individuals from asphyxiating due tot heir reduced size. That might be a neat direction to expand the article, but if you choose not to, its not a deal breaker.</p>
<p>+1. This article was a hoot.</p>

