<blockquote>
<p>saying that an owl doesn't understand perceptual phenomena is… well, wildly incorrect.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I meant that an owl doesn't have an intellectual understanding of perspective, or of optical illusions. <em>Humans</em> didn't until the Renaissance!</p>
<p>This owl was born with these abilities, it always could grab the small things and so on, so it never learned otherwise.</p>

